WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.396
Henry left Rabbit outside while he helped his parents.

2
00:00:06.397 --> 00:00:15.456
The family was cleaning and packing up the RV.

3
00:00:15.457 --> 00:00:19.544
At last they were finished.

4
00:00:19.545 --> 00:00:24.024
"Time to go home!" Dad said.

5
00:00:24.025 --> 00:00:27.709
Rabbit waited for Henry to come outside and get him.

6
00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:30.952
But Henry stayed on the RV.

7
00:00:30.953 --> 00:00:34.793
Then Dad started the loud engine.

8
00:00:34.794 --> 00:00:37.850
Rumble! Rumble!

9
00:00:37.851 --> 00:00:40.571
"Wait!" Rabbit cried.

10
00:00:40.572 --> 00:00:46.038
He watched in horror as the family drove away.

11
00:00:46.039 --> 00:00:49.124
"Henry will remember me," Rabbit thought.

12
00:00:49.125 --> 00:00:51.903
"Any minute now, they'll turn around."

13
00:00:51.904 --> 00:00:56.487
But the RV kept moving away from him.

14
00:00:56.488 --> 00:01:00.238
Soon Rabbit couldn't see it anymore.

15
00:01:00.239 --> 00:01:03.443
"This is terrible!" he thought.

16
00:01:03.444 --> 00:01:06.666
"What will happen to me?"

17
00:01:06.667 --> 00:01:09.178
The sun felt hot.

18
00:01:09.179 --> 00:01:16.784
In the woods branches snapped.

19
00:01:16.785 --> 00:01:24.401
A hawk swooped low.

20
00:01:24.402 --> 00:01:30.931
Every sound and shadow was spooky to Rabbit.

21
00:01:30.932 --> 00:01:35.164
"I'll never see Henry again," Rabbit thought.

22
00:01:35.165 --> 00:01:41.641
"I'll sit here by myself forever."

23
00:01:41.642 --> 00:01:44.515
Rumble! Rumble!

24
00:01:44.516 --> 00:01:46.971
Rabbit looked up.

25
00:01:46.972 --> 00:01:50.264
It was the RV!

26
00:01:50.265 --> 00:01:55.886
Henry jumped out and ran to Rabbit.

27
00:01:55.887 --> 00:02:08.518
"I'm so sorry, Rabbit," he said, crying.

28
00:02:08.519 --> 00:02:13.932
Dad laughed. "All this fuss for a toy!"

29
00:02:13.933 --> 00:02:18.574
"Rabbit is not a toy," Henry said.

30
00:02:18.575 --> 00:02:20.527
"He's real!

31
00:02:20.528 --> 00:02:26.872
He'll be my real friend forever!"

32
00:02:26.873 --> 00:02:30.262
Rabbit felt a warm glow inside.

33
00:02:30.263 --> 00:02:33.923
"Henry said I was real!" he thought.

34
00:02:33.924 --> 00:02:44.034
"Wait until I tell Horse and the others!"

